14-case node:test suite (test:reviewer-decisions) covering reviewer
authn/authz (401/403), dual-role self-review prevention, valid
under_review -> approved|rejected decisions with persisted reviewer
audit fields, invalid-state and repeated decisions failing 409 with
zero side effects, malformed/unknown-id and missing-reason validation,
approved/rejected lifecycle-event emission (owner userId, from/to),
transactional one-notification-per-event creation with provider-safe
content, ownership isolation, and privacy (no reviewerNotes/reviewedBy/
reviewer-private text on provider surfaces; rejection reason only on
the status surface, never in notification bodies). Existing harness,
no new framework; no app/API/schema changes.
